  <div><p class="over">About us</p></div>
  <div>
    <p class="st">Since 1984 we have connected Sarajevo with sport, the mountains and great events. We manage the Olympic centres Bjelašnica–Igman and Zetra, preserving their legacy and developing them for new generations.</p>
    <div class="dj">
      <div><h3 class="h">Sport</h3><p>Venues for recreation, training and sports competitions.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="h">Events</h3><p>Concerts, fairs and gatherings that bring people together.</p></div>
