    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="o-nama-en.html">More about us <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
