    <p class="over w">Sarajevo 1984</p>
    <h2 class="h">The Games<br>that shaped<br>Sarajevo</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="tx2">
    <p>In February 1984 Sarajevo hosted the XIV Olympic Winter Games and became the centre of world sport. The Games left a legacy that still lives on in our Olympic venues. ZOI'84 takes its name from those Games.</p>
    <a class="btn ol" href="nasljedje-en.html">Explore the heritage <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
  </div>
  <div class="emb" id="zoi3d" data-color="#D8462A" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

